msgstr "Atur ulang posisi penanda jeda"

msgid "Pick an edge, or drag the tag anywhere by its body. Keyless remembers where you leave it. Only its Resume button resumes."
msgstr "Pilih tepi, atau seret penanda ke mana saja. Keyless mengingat tempat Anda meletakkannya. Hanya tombol Lanjutkan miliknya yang melanjutkan."

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "Lanjutkan"

msgid "Pause to try it"
msgstr "Jeda untuk mencoba"

msgid "Pause your keyboard. Keep your mouse."
msgstr "Jeda keyboard. Mouse tetap jalan."

msgid "VERSION {} · MIT LICENSE"
msgstr "VERSI {} · LISENSI MIT"

msgid "PRIVACY"
msgstr "PRIVASI"

msgid "Keyless looks at each key only to decide whether to block it. Nothing is recorded, stored or sent. No network, no telemetry."
msgstr "Keyless melihat setiap tombol hanya untuk memutuskan apakah akan memblokirnya. Tidak ada yang direkam, disimpan, atau dikirim. Tanpa jaringan, tanpa telemetri."

msgid "GOOD TO KNOW"
msgstr "PERLU DIKETAHUI"

msgid "Control Alt Delete always works."
msgstr "Ctrl Alt Delete selalu berfungsi."

msgid "always works."
msgstr "selalu berfungsi."

msgid "On-screen keyboards and voice typing keep working while paused."
msgstr "Keyboard layar dan pengetikan suara tetap berfungsi saat dijeda."

