msgid "Only {} resumes while the mouse is paused. Locking the screen, signing out or sleep resumes both."
msgstr "Hanya {} yang melanjutkan saat mouse dijeda. Mengunci layar, keluar, atau tidur melanjutkan keduanya."

msgid "Always on while the mouse pauses too."
msgstr "Selalu aktif saat mouse juga dijeda."

msgid "Mouse pauses too"
msgstr "Mouse juga dijeda"

msgid "Press {} to resume"
msgstr "Tekan {} untuk melanjutkan"

msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Mouse"

msgid "Lock both"
msgstr "Kunci keduanya"

msgid "Clicks paused"
msgstr "Klik dijeda"

msgid "Frozen while paused"
msgstr "Beku saat dijeda"

msgid "Pause it with the keyboard, so nothing gets clicked."
msgstr "Jeda bersama keyboard, agar tidak ada yang terklik."

msgid "Keeps working"
msgstr "Tetap berfungsi"

msgid "Only the keyboard pauses."
msgstr "Hanya keyboard yang dijeda."

msgid "Block clicks"
msgstr "Blokir klik"

msgid "Clicks and scrolling stop. The pointer still moves."
msgstr "Klik dan gulir berhenti. Penunjuk tetap bergerak."

msgid "Freeze it"
msgstr "Bekukan"

msgid "Clicks, scrolling and the pointer stop."
msgstr "Klik, gulir, dan penunjuk berhenti."

msgid "RESUME WITH"
msgstr "LANJUTKAN DENGAN"

msgid "No shortcut set"
msgstr "Belum ada pintasan"

msgid "Set a shortcut"
msgstr "Atur pintasan"

msgid "Pick Block clicks or Freeze it to pause the mouse too. Only the shortcut resumes then, so it always resumes."
msgstr "Pilih Blokir klik atau Bekukan untuk menjeda mouse juga. Setelah itu hanya pintasan yang melanjutkan, jadi pintasan selalu melanjutkan."

msgid "The mouse keeps working until a shortcut is set, because only the shortcut can resume it."
msgstr "Mouse tetap berfungsi sampai pintasan diatur, karena hanya pintasan yang dapat melanjutkannya."

msgid "Locking the screen, signing out or sleep resumes both. Ctrl + Alt + Delete always works."
msgstr "Mengunci layar, keluar, atau tidur melanjutkan keduanya. Ctrl + Alt + Delete selalu berfungsi."

msgid "The mouse keeps working while paused"
msgstr "Mouse tetap berfungsi saat dijeda"

msgid "Clicks and scrolling are blocked while paused; the pointer still moves"
msgstr "Klik dan gulir diblokir saat dijeda; penunjuk tetap bergerak"

msgid "Clicks, scrolling and the pointer are blocked while paused"
msgstr "Klik, gulir, dan penunjuk diblokir saat dijeda"

msgid "Hide the paused tag?"
msgstr "Sembunyikan tanda jeda?"

msgid "Pause the mouse with the tag hidden?"
msgstr "Jeda mouse dengan tanda tersembunyi?"

msgid "Keyboard and mouse will both pause, and nothing on screen will say how to resume. Only {} resumes."
msgstr "Keyboard dan mouse akan dijeda, dan tidak ada di layar yang menunjukkan cara melanjutkan. Hanya {} yang melanjutkan."

msgid "Hide it"
msgstr "Sembunyikan"

msgid "Pause the mouse"
msgstr "Jeda mouse"

msgid "Keep it"
msgstr "Tetap tampilkan"

msgid "Pick an edge, or drag the tag anywhere by its body. Keyless remembers where you leave it. While the mouse pauses, it shows the shortcut instead of a Resume button."
msgstr "Pilih tepi, atau seret tanda ke mana saja lewat badannya. Keyless mengingat tempat Anda meninggalkannya. Saat mouse dijeda, tanda menampilkan pintasan, bukan tombol Lanjutkan."

msgid "Both paused"
msgstr "Keduanya dijeda"

msgid "Press {} to resume."
msgstr "Tekan {} untuk melanjutkan."

msgid "BOTH ASLEEP"
msgstr "KEDUANYA TIDUR"

msgid "Pauses keyboard and mouse"
msgstr "Menjeda keyboard dan mouse"

msgid "Keyless: keyboard and mouse paused"
msgstr "Keyless: keyboard dan mouse dijeda"
